Whenever you’re ready tomorrow, just come back and tell me, and I’ll generate the <strong data-start="109" data-end="151">complete theory for the entire project</strong>, page by page, in a <strong data-start="172" data-end="229">clear, school-appropriate, handwritten-project format</strong>.</p>
