<ul data-start="239" data-end="459">
<li data-start="239" data-end="311">
<p data-start="241" data-end="311">Write <strong data-start="247" data-end="267">exactly 15 pages</strong> (or adjust if your teacher wants more/less)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="312" data-end="370">
<p data-start="314" data-end="370">Keep the language <strong data-start="332" data-end="370">simple, formal, and Class 11 level</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="371" data-end="410">
<p data-start="373" data-end="410">Maintain <strong data-start="382" data-end="410">proper flow and headings</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="411" data-end="459">
